  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>How to choose your sizeOur sizing buttons list the Women’s size first (W) and the equivalent Big Kids' size second (K)Ex. If you usually wear a Big Kids’ size 5.5, select the button with W 7 / K 5.5If only one size is listed, select your typical women’s size.Product Features Premium leather upper\nLow-profile design for sleek style\nPatent leather Swoosh detailing delivers a luxe look\nPadded collar offers additional comfort\nLightweight cushioned midsole offers supportive relief\nPerforations at toebox for increased ventilation\nRubber outsole with classic hoops pivot circle for reliable grip across surfaces\nClassic lace closure secures the fit\nThe Nike Dunk Low is imported.\nThese Women's Nike Dunk Low Casual Shoes speak for themselves as the forerunners of streetwear fashion footwear. Crafted with supple, premium leather uppers, this iteration of the streetwise staple sneaker sports patent leather Swooshes and an eye-catching pink hue.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's Nike Dunk Low Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Sail/Metallic Silver/Mink Brown</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3337948</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weigh